---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Research Roadmap" 
  description="Research roadmap of Rex Autistikōn Labs — from computational model to experimental validation."
>
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Research Roadmap</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-12">
        Our work moves from theoretical formalization and interactive modelling 
        toward empirical tests that can confirm, refine, or falsify the core hypothesis.
      </p>

      <!-- Phase 1 -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-teal-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold">1</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Phase 1 — Formalization & Interactive Model</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ml-11 border-l-2 border-teal-200 pl-6 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
          <p class="font-medium text-teal-800">Status: Active</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
            <li>Core biotensegrity-informed hypothesis published with open DOI</li>
            <li>Pilot Study Collaborator Handbook released</li>
            <li>Phase 1 Interactive Model deployed (Normal vs Neurodivergent parameter sets)</li>
            <li>Mathematical formalization of viscoelastic filtering, precision, and free-energy gradients</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 2 -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-300 text-slate-700 text-sm font-semibold">2</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Phase 2 — Experimental Design & Pilot Measurements</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ml-11 border-l-2 border-slate-200 pl-6 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-500">Status: Planning</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
            <li>Shear-wave elastography protocols for the eight sensor-rich zones</li>
            <li>Interoceptive accuracy tasks and heartbeat-evoked potential measurements</li>
            <li>MPA–Zone scoring system for participant stratification</li>
            <li>Pre-registration of pilot study methods</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 3 -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-300 text-slate-700 text-sm font-semibold">3</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Phase 3 — Intervention & Correlation Studies</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ml-11 border-l-2 border-slate-200 pl-6 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-500">Status: Future</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
            <li>Targeted fascial interventions in well-characterized cohorts</li>
            <li>Correlation of reduced local stiffness/viscosity with changes in interoceptive markers</li>
            <li>Open data and protocol release</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 4 -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-300 text-slate-700 text-sm font-semibold">4</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Phase 4 — Higher-Fidelity Modelling</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ml-11 border-l-2 border-slate-200 pl-6 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
          <p class="font-medium text-slate-500">Status: Future</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
            <li>Integration with soft-tissue simulation frameworks (e.g. SOFA / NTRTsim)</li>
            <li>Anatomical and 3D visualization of tension dynamics</li>
            <li>Publicly accessible refined interactive tools</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
        This roadmap is provisional and will be updated as results and collaborations develop. 
        All primary outputs will continue to be released under open-access principles whenever possible.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>